# UI / Design System

Direction: cold sky / navy hardware catalog — **not** neon gamer kitsch.

## Palette

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Background | `#FBFBFB` |
| Surface | `#D4EAFB` |
| Elevated | `#B8DCF9` |
| Text / ink | `#0D47A1` |
| Muted / clay | `#2196F3` |
| Border / sage | `#90CAF9` |
| Accent | `#2196F3` — **sparingly** |

## Typography

- Display: Space Grotesk  
- Body: Geist / Inter  
- Technical: JetBrains Mono  

## Avoid

Excessive neon/gradients/glow, glassmorphism spam, huge glowing headlines, earth-tone vintage palettes unless requested.

## Layout notes

- Homepage = one continuous visual story; hero budget is tight.
- Builder desktop: left nav | center 3D | right summary. Mobile: step-by-step.
- Product cards: image, name, category, price, rating, key spec, stock + subtle hover.

Full: `docs/ui-design.md`.
